Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 11:34:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add non-ROS MPC (MPC-MRT) module and test pipeline for
 ALOHA dual-arm

Adds ocs2_mobile_manipulator_nonros: a ROS-free MPC-MRT node for the ALOHA
dual-arm manipulator communicating over a shared-memory transport, plus its
launch/scripts, MuJoCo viewer, ALOHA reference converter, and unit/integration
tests (shm transport, fanout, converter, ACT publisher).

Folds together:
- add non-ros mpc and test pipeline
- validation bug fix
